%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e7311bb0212e39408fe5fc2eeafe3e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Leeroy_Scammer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  victimName: Leeroy Jenkins
  steps:
  - victimLine: Hello? Who is this?
    choices:
    - text: This is Agent Davis, IRS fraud division. Is this Leeroy Jenkins?
      trustDelta: 15
      isGood: 1
      label: Professional Opener
    - text: Hey, we need your money. Give it up.
      trustDelta: -25
      isGood: 0
      label: Immediately suspicious
    - text: Don't hang up. This is an emergency government call.
      trustDelta: 8
      isGood: 1
      label: Vague Urgency
  - victimLine: The IRS? Oh no. Is something wrong with my taxes?
    choices:
    - text: Yes, you owe $12,000. Pay now or go to jail.
      trustDelta: -28
      isGood: 0
      label: Too blunt, too fast
    - text: Not taxes. We've flagged criminal use of your SSN
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: Reframes the threat
    - text: We need to verify your identity before I can say more.
      trustDelta: 10
      isGood: 1
      label: Builds suspense
  - victimLine: Criminal use? That sounds serious. How do you know it's me?
    choices:
    - text: I can't share details on an unsecured line. For your protection.
      trustDelta: 15
      isGood: 1
      label: Classic deflection
    - text: We just know, okay? Trust me.
      trustDelta: -22
      isGood: 0
      label: Destroys credibility
    - text: We have your SSN ending in 4471 flagged on three accounts in Texas.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: Fake specific detail
  - victimLine: Oh no. What happens if I don't do anything?
    choices:
    - text: A federal warrant will be issued within 24 hours. We're trying to stop
        that.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: Deadline pressure
    - text: You get arrested today. Simple as that.
      trustDelta: -25
      isGood: 0
      label: Too aggressive
    - text: Local police have already been notified. We're your only help now.
      trustDelta: 12
      isGood: 1
      label: False ally framing
  - victimLine: Should I call my son? He handles this sort of thing for me.
    choices:
    - text: Sure, go ahead. We'll arrest him too.
      trustDelta: -30
      isGood: 0
      label: Absurd threat
    - text: Your son may already be a person of interest. Stay quiet for now.
      trustDelta: 15
      isGood: 1
      label: Implicates family
    - text: Do not contact anyone. It could compromise the federal investigation.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: Isolation tactic
  - victimLine: 'I''m not sure about this. How do I know you''re really the IRS? '
    choices:
    - text: I'll hold while you look up the IRS fraud division number yourself.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: Confident bluff
    - text: Call the IRS main line. Ask for case number 887-Delta. They'll confirm.
      trustDelta: 22
      isGood: 1
      label: Fake verifiable detail
    - text: Because I said so! Stop asking questions.
      trustDelta: -28
      isGood: 0
      label: Hostile, destroys trust
  - victimLine: 'Okay... so what exactly do I need to do to fix this? '
    choices:
    - text: Send $5,000 in gift cards to this address immediately.
      trustDelta: -35
      isGood: 0
      label: Classic gift card tell
    - text: I'll transfer you to my supervisor, Senior Agent Wallace, badge 3392.
      trustDelta: 15
      isGood: 1
      label: Fake authority chain
    - text: We need to move your savings into a secure government holding account
        temporarily.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: Soft financial ask
  - victimLine: 'Victim Line: A holding account? I''ve never heard of that before. '
    choices:
    - text: It's a new federal protection program. Only offered to at-risk seniors
        like yourself.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: Flattery + fake program
    - text: Just do it. Time is running out.
      trustDelta: -25
      isGood: 0
      label: Impatient, raises flags
    - text: The alternative is asset seizure. This is the safer option.
      trustDelta: 14
      isGood: 1
      label: Fear of worse outcome
  - victimLine: 'Victim Line: Alright. I suppose if it protects me... how much are
      we talking? '
    choices:
    - text: Everything you have. Don't be difficult.
      trustDelta: -40
      isGood: 0
      label: Greedy, immediate red flag
    - text: Whatever you can access today. Every hour increases your legal risk.
      trustDelta: 15
      isGood: 1
      label: Vague pressure close
    - text: Just $2,500 to secure the account. You'll get it back once cleared.
      trustDelta: 25
      isGood: 1
      label: Reasonable-sounding ask
